### Schedule API Testing - Simple Version

# Base URL
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7024/api/Schedule

### 1. Get All Schedules
GET {{baseUrl}}/GetAllSchedule
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Get Schedule by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/GetById?id=1
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Create New Schedule
POST {{baseUrl}}/Create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mssv": "SE182073",
  "className": "SE1820",
  "subjectName": "Advanced Programming",
  "scheduleTime": "2024-12-15T08:00:00"
}

### 4. Update Schedule
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "mssv": "SE182073",
  "className": "SE1820",
  "subjectName": "Advanced Programming - Updated",
  "scheduleTime": "2024-12-15T09:00:00"
}

### 5. Delete Schedule
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Delete?id=1
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Test with different MSSV
POST {{baseUrl}}/Create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mssv": "SE182074",
  "className": "SE1821",
  "subjectName": "Database Design",
  "scheduleTime": "2024-12-16T10:00:00"
}

### 7. Test with different class
POST {{baseUrl}}/Create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mssv": "SE182073",
  "className": "SE1822",
  "subjectName": "Web Development",
  "scheduleTime": "2024-12-17T14:00:00"
}
